  "summary": "Race condition in 'docker cp' in github.com/docker/docker allows bind mount redirection",
  "details": "A race condition in the Docker daemon allows an attacker to redirect bind mounts to arbitrary host paths during a \"docker cp\" operation.\n\nThe affected code is in the daemon package, specifically the openContainerFS method. This is daemon-owned, Linux-specific code and is not intended for external use as a Go library.",
